# Explicit line endings. Without this, what git stores depends on each
# machine's core.autocrlf: the Windows run writes its data files with CRLF
# (Python text mode) while CI on Linux writes LF, so the two runners would see
# every line as changed and fight over the branch.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
